        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">A follow on from <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3718967642\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28636\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28636/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28636\">#28636</a> as I missed one header :-(</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://www.tunetheweb.com/experiments/sec-ch-width/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.tunetheweb.com/experiments/sec-ch-width/</a></p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/527851131-983a9338-9902-47e8-b3e5-607fbe9190cb.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..kH9zvJ0hM6HTaN0QmIjTnvplNTg2LftaP8Ormz9zeAk\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1558\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/527851131-983a9338-9902-47e8-b3e5-607fbe9190cb.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..kH9zvJ0hM6HTaN0QmIjTnvplNTg2LftaP8Ormz9zeAk\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1558px;\"></a>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Docs: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3740953803\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42453\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42453/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42453\">mdn/content#42453</a></p>\n",
