        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Expand No-Vary-Search data, splitting out prefetch and prerender to separate keys and also add HTTP Cache support</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">For HTTP Cache:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Visit: <a href=\"https://www.tunetheweb.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.tunetheweb.com/</a></li>\n<li>Open DevTools</li>\n<li>Make sure \"Disable cache\" is unticked</li>\n<li>Add random ULR params (e.g. <a href=\"https://www.tunetheweb.com/?test=1234\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.tunetheweb.com/?test=1234</a>)</li>\n<li>Note the resource is served from the Disk cache</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5808599110254592\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5808599110254592</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
